OL,3,ASeven shot dead by gunmen at church
OL,4,Afuneral in Jordan, state media say
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least seven people were killed when
OL,7,Ftwo gunmen opened fire on a funeral in
OL,8,Fcentral Jordan, the country's state
OL,9,Fmedia report.
OL,11,FAnother 10 people were injured in the
OL,12,Fchurch in the Karak governorate on
OL,13,FFriday.
OL,15,FThe unidentified gunmen are reported to
OL,16,Fhave arrived in a car and began
OL,17,Fshooting inside the church before
OL,18,Ffleeing the scene.
OL,20,FSecurity forces have been deployed,
OL,21,Fgovernment spokesman Mohammad al-Momani
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
